reckon 0
pack minimal

--- Kinds, slots and an enum written in Reckon (docs/reckon/publication.md §5.1, §5.2), beside the pack
--- `minimal`, whose kind Alpha and enum State it names. kinds.yaml says the same in LinkML; the compiler
--- gives both the same bundle and the same engine. Neutral names on purpose; it describes no domain.

enum Grade = first | second | third

kind Gamma world closed
  since: Date?
  note: Text
  grade: Grade?

kind Delta world closed
  gamma: Gamma
  alpha: Alpha
  state: State?
  grade: Grade
